!/docs/40-readiness/TEMPORAL-DEV-EVIDENCE.md
!/docs/40-readiness/WEB-DOCKER-EVIDENCE.md

# Private evidence and deployment material stay local, byte-identical.
/validation/

# Secrets, IDE state and generated runtime material are never public inputs.
**/.idea/
**/node_modules/
**/runtime/
**/cache/
**/.cache/
**/_logs/
**/.npmrc
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/DRAFT.md
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/.DS_Store
/dist/
/coverage/
